## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107, 11509
## Title: Azeroth Academy
## Notes: Free, kid-friendly learning quests inside Azeroth. Rune Forger (math), Scribe's Scrolls (spelling, words, typing), Lore Chronicles (reading & writing) and Azeroth Naturalist (science), plus Duel of Wits learning races with friends. /aa to open.
